s on fundamentals, ratings, and markets, all of which point to a comfortable but not entirely risk-free Democratic hold.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9628, "margin": 12.37}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9577, "margin": 12.4}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9584, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9615, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9427, "margin": 12.0}]}